permalink to solve the problem.'=>'请重新保存永久链接以解决问题。','Where Can I change Event Slug Url?'=>'在哪里可以更改事件 Slug URL？','In Event Settings area we have slug changing option. You can change it and resave permalink to avoid 404 error.'=>'在“事件设置”区域中，我们有“子弹更换”选项。您可以更改它并重新保存永久链接以避免 404 错误。','Where Can I configure Pdf Email?'=>'在哪里可以配置 PDF 电子邮件？','If you visit Event settings page then You will see PDF email tab top right, you can configure pdf email here.'=>'如果您访问活动设置页面，您将在右上角看到 PDF 电子邮件选项卡，您可以在此处配置 pdf 电子邮件。','I have configured correctly but pdf email I am not getting.'=>'我已正确配置，但我没有收到 pdf 电子邮件。','PDF email with pdf send based on some configuration. If order status processing or complete then only pdf email will send as we considered these 2 order status come after order payment done. If order status holds or pending, then email of pdf will not send.'=>'基于某些配置的 PDF 电子邮件和 pdf 发送。如果订单状态正在处理或完成，则只会发送 pdf 电子邮件，因为我们认为这 2 个订单状态是在订单付款完成后出现的。如果订单状态为保留或待处理，则不会发送 pdf 电子邮件。','Can I hide any section from event list and details page?'=>'我可以隐藏活动列表和详细信息页面中的任何部分吗？','Yes You can hide any section from event list and details page. If you go event settings area in general section, you will find lots of settings regarding all section.'=>'是的，您可以隐藏事件列表和详细信息页面中的任何部分。如果您进入常规部分的事件设置区域，您会发现有关所有部分的许多设置。','How Can I configure Virtual Event?'=>'如何配置虚拟活动？','For virtual event we know there should not have any location or physical address so we recommend to use template virtual that we have during event adding time and also you can use location hide settings from list and details page.'=>'对于虚拟事件，我们知道不应该有任何位置或物理地址，因此我们建议使用我们在事件添加期间拥有的虚拟模板，并且您也可以使用列表和详细信息页面中的位置隐藏设置。','I installed event manager plugin but it does not work?'=>'我安装了事件管理器插件但它不起作用？','Please install WooCommerce plugin first, before installing any plugin.'=>'在安装任何插件之前，请先安装 WooCommerce 插件。','Do you offer customization?'=>'你们提供定制服务吗？','Yes! we offer customization service for our client. If you want any new features don’t hesitate to contact us. Email: magepeopleteam@gmail.com.'=>'是的！我们为客户提供定制服务。如果您需要任何新功能，请随时与我们联系。电子邮件：magepeopleteam@gmail.com。','WooCommerce is already installed but not active. Click the button below to activate it right now.'=>'WooCommerce 已安装但未激活。单击下面的按钮立即激活它。','WooCommerce is required to process payments. We will securely download, install, and activate it for you right now.'=>'WooCommerce 需要处理付款。我们将立即为您安全地下载、安装并激活它。','Activate WooCommerce Now'=>'立即激活 WooCommerce','Install &amp; Activate Now'=>'安装&amp;立即激活','Set Up WooCommerce'=>'设置 WooCommerce','Activating WooCommerce...'=>'激活 WooCommerce...','Configuring settings...'=>'配置设置...','Finalizing setup...'=>'正在完成设置...','Downloading WooCommerce...'=>'正在下载 WooCommerce...','Installing WooCommerce...'=>'正在安装 WooCommerce...','Finalizing...'=>'正在敲定...','Successfully Activated! 100%'=>'激活成功！ 100%','Error: '=>'错误： ','A network error occurred. Please try again.'=>'发生网络错误。请再试一次。','Offline Payment'=>'线下支付','PayPal Configuration'=>'贝宝配置','Enable PayPal'=>'启用贝宝','Accept payments via PayPal'=>'通过 PayPal 接受付款','Sandbox / Test Mode'=>'沙盒/测试模式','Use sandbox credentials for testing'=>'使用沙盒凭据进行测试','API Credentials'=>'API 凭证','PayPal Client ID'=>'贝宝客户 ID','Enter your PayPal Client ID'=>'输入您的 PayPal 客户 ID','PayPal Secret Key'=>'贝宝密钥','Enter your PayPal Secret Key'=>'输入您的 PayPal 密钥','Save PayPal Settings'=>'保存贝宝设置','Stripe Configuration'=>'条带配置','Enable Stripe'=>'启用条纹','Accept payments via Stripe'=>'通过 Stripe 接受付款','Use test keys instead of live keys'=>'使用测试密钥而不是实时密钥','Test / Sandbox Keys'=>'测试/沙箱密钥','Test Publishable Key'=>'测试可发布密钥','Test Secret Key'=>'测试密钥','Live Keys'=>'实时按键','Live Publishable Key'=>'实时发布密钥','Live Secret Key'=>'实时密钥','Save Stripe Settings'=>'保存条纹设置','Offline Payment Configuration'=>'离线支付配置','Enable Offline Payment'=>'启用离线支付','Let customers pay offline (bank transfer, cash, pay at venue).'=>'让客户进行线下支付（银行转账、现金、现场支付）。','Payment Label'=>'付款标签','e.g. Pay at Venue / Bank Transfer'=>'例如现场付款/银行转账','This label is shown to customers on the frontend payment page.'