king, ensure this is set to "No".'=>'仅当您的主题已包含 Owl Carousel 库时，才选择“是”。选择“否”（推荐）让插件加载自己的 Owl Carousel 库。如果轮播不起作用，请确保将其设置为“否”。','No - Load from Plugin (Recommended)'=>'否 - 从插件加载（推荐）','Yes - Load from Theme'=>'是 - 从主题加载','Auto Play'=>'自动播放','Infinite Loop'=>'无限循环','Slider Type'=>'滑块型','Slider'=>'滑块','Post Thumbnail'=>'帖子缩略图','Slider Style'=>'滑块样式','Style One'=>'风格一','Style Two'=>'风格二','ON'=>'开','Off'=>'关闭','Icon Indicator'=>'图标指示器','image Indicator'=>'图像指示器','At Top Position'=>'处于最高位置','At Right Position'=>'在正确的位置','At Bottom Position'=>'位于底部位置','At Left Position'=>'在左侧位置','Minimum'=>'最低','Average'=>'平均','Maximum'=>'最大','Install & Activate Now'=>'立即安装并激活','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Custom Payment'=>'定制支付','Notice: WooCommerce is Not Activated'=>'注意：WooCommerce 未激活','To actually use the "Ticket-Selling" event type and allow ticket sales, you must install and activate WooCommerce.'=>'要实际使用“售票”活动类型并允许售票，您必须安装并激活 WooCommerce。','After Adding to Cart, Redirect to'=>'添加到购物车后，重定向到','Cart'=>'购物车','Checkout'=>'结账','After Confirming the Order, Redirect To'=>'确认订单后，重定向至','Plugin Thank You Page'=>'插件感谢页面','WooCommerce Thank You Page'=>'WooCommerce 感谢页面','Confirm Ticket Based on Payment Status'=>'根据付款状态确认门票','Pending payment'=>'待付款','Processing'=>'加工','On hold'=>'暂停','Completed'=>'已完成','PayPal'=>'贝宝','Configure'=>'配置','Available in Pro version'=>'提供专业版','Stripe'=>'条纹','Booking Confirmation Page'=>'预订确认页面','Select a page with the [mep_booking_confirmation] shortcode. After booking, customers are redirected here instead of back to the event page.'=>'选择带有 [mep_booking_confirmation] 短代码的页面。预订后，客户将被重定向至此处，而不是返回活动页面。','— Default —'=>'— 默认 —','WooCommerce is active'=>'WooCommerce 处于活动状态','Currency display is controlled by WooCommerce settings. The settings below are used as a fallback when WooCommerce is deactivated.'=>'货币显示由 WooCommerce 设置控制。以下设置用作停用 WooCommerce 时的后备设置。','WooCommerce is not active'=>'WooCommerce 未激活','These currency settings are used for price display and the native ch